brave men,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l011","ordinal":332218,"en":"And ravaging all the borderlands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l012","ordinal":332219,"en":"Six swift horses came,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l013","ordinal":332220,"en":"Bringing word to lion-hearted, noble Manas:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l014","ordinal":332221,"en":"“The monster has brought us misery,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l015","ordinal":332222,"en":"“He has burned our country.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l016","ordinal":332223,"en":"A letter small as a palm arrived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l017","ordinal":332224,"en":"And when the tidings reached them,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l018","ordinal":332225,"en":"Azhybay and old Bakai were there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l019","ordinal":332226,"en":"And all the valiant warriors were there."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l020","ordinal":332227,"en":"Almambet, Syrgak, and Chubak were there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l021","ordinal":332228,"en":"And many wise old men were there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l022","ordinal":332229,"en":"And all the valiant warriors were there."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l023","ordinal":332230,"en":"They mounted in fierce excitement,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l024","ordinal":332231,"en":"And the heroes rode out together."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l025","ordinal":332232,"en":"They joined Zharmanas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l026","ordinal":332233,"en":"And camped beyond seven ridges,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l027","ordinal":332234,"en":"Coming to their brother-in-law’s aid."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l028","ordinal":332235,"en":"After seven days of slaughter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l029","ordinal":332236,"en":"The fortress walls collapsed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l030","ordinal":332237,"en":"The immeasurably mighty monster"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l031","ordinal":332238,"en":"Fell dead at Khan Manas’s hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l032","ordinal":332239,"en":"And his people scattered like frightened birds."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l033","ordinal":332240,"en":"Many of his warriors died,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l034","ordinal":332241,"en":"And those who remained alive"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l035","ordinal":332242,"en":"Were divided among them as spoils."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l036","ordinal":332243,"en":"“They slaughtered the monster,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l037","ordinal":332244,"en":"“They put him to death,” they said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l038","ordinal":332245,"en":"His fame remained throughout the world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l039","ordinal":332246,"en":"As did the renown of our father."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b002:l040","ordinal":332247,"en":"“God has taken his father;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l001","ordinal":332248,"en":"Let us fight and avenge him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l002","ordinal":332249,"en":"If that warrior is still alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l003","ordinal":332250,"en":"Let us unite with him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l004","ordinal":332251,"en":"From grievous torment and affliction"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l005","ordinal":332252,"en":"Let us deliver him!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l006","ordinal":332253,"en":"After he had spoken thus,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l007","ordinal":332254,"en":"They prepared themselves in fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l008","ordinal":332255,"en":"And to those bloodthirsty warriors"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l009","ordinal":332256,"en":"Inspiration came from the unseen."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l010","ordinal":332257,"en":"They readied all their weapons,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l011","ordinal":332258,"en":"And girded on naked swords—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l012","ordinal":332259,"en":"Heroic Seytek and Külchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l013","ordinal":332260,"en":"Those brave wolves of war."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l014","ordinal":332261,"en":"Unable to stand still when they heard,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l015","ordinal":332262,"en":"Brave Semetey and his champions joined them."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l016","ordinal":332263,"en":"Their eighty-four kinds of armor were donned,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l017","ordinal":332264,"en":"And their sweeping onset blazed like fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l018","ordinal":332265,"en":"Stones split and mountains crumbled"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l019","ordinal":332266,"en":"As they thundered forth in menace."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l020","ordinal":332267,"en":"From the Argyn and the Kyrgyz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l021","ordinal":332268,"en":"They formed a host of ten thousand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l022","ordinal":332269,"en":"Mustering an army in a tumult"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l023","ordinal":332270,"en":"As dust soared into the sky."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l024","ordinal":332271,"en":"They sharpened their true-steel spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l025","ordinal":332272,"en":"And in a single day their valor"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l026","ordinal":332273,"en":"Seemed ready to overturn"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l027","ordinal":332274,"en":"The frost-hardened black earth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l028","ordinal":332275,"en":"Then Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l029","ordinal":332276,"en":"Put on his bulletproof coat"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l030","ordinal":332277,"en":"And prepared himself in fury:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l031","ordinal":332278,"en":"“While our mighty heads remain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l032","ordinal":332279,"en":"Let us exact a fearful price in slaughter."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l033","ordinal":332280,"en":"If Sarybay is truly formidable,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l034","ordinal":332281,"en":"Let us go and fight him to the death!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l035","ordinal":332282,"en":"I have learned this from the chroniclers,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l036","ordinal":332283,"en":"And questioned a thousand wise men."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l037","ordinal":332284,"en":"Yesterday, when he crossed Zhan-Zhürbös,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l038","ordinal":332285,"en":"And the vast hazy desert closed around him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l039","ordinal":332286,"en":"Zharmanas of that wicked people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l040","ordinal":332287,"en":"Proved to be our brother-in-law."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l001","ordinal":332288,"en":"Surely this is the day he came seeking help."}]
